  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Ingest & truth",
      "items": [
        "One direction of truth: simulator → Postgres → API → UI. The dashboard never calls the simulator.",
        "REST is the source of truth; SSE /v1/stream only triggers a re-GET, with no Last-Event-ID replay (backend/simulator_client.py:30, backend/collector.py:418).",
        "Nine /v1/* reads plus per-station demand-history are assembled into one WorldSnapshot per tick (backend/collector.py:314).",
        "No anchor from /v1/instance means no snapshot, so the UI shows “no data” instead of zeros (backend/collector.py:338)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Decision loop",
      "items": [
        "No allocation without an approved recommendation; every item carries idempotency_key = {recommendation_id}:{item_seq} (backend/simulator_client.py:146).",
        "Approve issues one POST /v1/allocations per item; status moves PENDING → IN_TRANSIT → ARRIVED/FAILED (backend/models.py:268).",
        "Risk is recomputed per tick and again on every allocation status change (backend/collector.py:418).",
        "The dashboard disables Approve whenever the collector reports stale data (DOCS/UserFlow.md:29)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Resilience by design",
      "items": [
        "Three attempts at 1s/2s/4s, then the last-good payload is served with is_stale=true (backend/simulator_client.py:71).",
        "X-Simulator-Stale is served once and never poisons the cache (backend/simulator_client.py:100).",
        "Forecaster drops to a 6-tick moving average below 20 history rows (backend/forecast.py:86).",
        "Optimizer drops to nearest-depot greedy and sets human_review_requested (backend/optimizer.py:270)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Design vs. committed code",
      "items": [
        "collector.run_pipeline() only logs, so detect, optimize and explain are not yet on the runtime path (backend/collector.py:386).",
        "Redis :6379 is declared in backend/requirements.txt:8, but no committed module reads it.",
        "anomaly.py, explainer.py, risk.py and health.py are specified in DOCS/BackendImplementation.md:13 but not created yet.",
        "docker compose brings up db, redis, the organizer image, api and web; there is no CI workflow and no load-test config yet."
      ]
    }
  ]
